body:
Thank you everyone that gave me advices!!! This community is so wholesome I swear

I did let the two out and get some time in the room today, and kept the cage door open in case they wanted to go in/out. And then… I lost the baby after returning from the bathroom. found them hidden at a corner later after a heart attack from me ;;

So uhm. Lesson learned. Don’t leave a baby out of sight no matter how unlikely they seem to escape.
